window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When an ancient relic of Scotland goes missing, Niall, a powerful enchanter, is the prime suspect. Elle's investigation takes her to the Outer Hebrides with Fergie the werewolf, Rebecca the spell witch, and three goblins. There, they meet a very special client, one who will change her enchantress path. Forever.<br><br>Elle is determined to learn the truth about herself, Niall, the coven, her mother, and the missing relic. What she learns could destroy all she holds dear. Above all, Elle and her witchy entourage must recover the missing relic before it's too late. Not just for all of witchdom, but for Scotland... <br><br>WITCH DETECTIVES is a compelling and darkly funny paranormal mystery series with fast-paced plots that twist and turn, witchy romance, and supernatural thrills.</p>"; 
